  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <blockquote><strong><em>\"Get closer to the customer, communicate, be transparent...\"</em></strong></blockquote>\n          <p><em>Michael Cohen, general manager of Bagel Corner.</em></p>\n          <p>Communicate, inform, reinvent: 3 watchwords that clearly emerge from this crisis.</p>\n          <p>The idea is not ours, but <strong>Michael Cohen</strong>, co-founder of <strong>Bagel Corner</strong>, who was our guest the day after the announcement of the reopening of the restaurants.</p>\n          <p>In this 8th episode of Restaurateurs de Demain, we meet Michael and his straightforwardness, his expertise of the market, his feedback on the takeover of his outlets, as well as the new formulas and actions implemented to strengthen the link with the brand's customers.</p>\n          <p>So ready for this new episode?<br>Enjoy!</p>\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:33.75%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-center w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://widget.ausha.co/index.html?chanId=brd64SKN4weM&amp;showId=brpMZCZkNxWJ&amp;color=%23333333&amp;display=horizontal&amp;v=2&amp;height=200px&amp;autonext=1&amp;podcastId=ykwqvU6r9Q1M\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <h2>Guest of the week</h2>\n          <figure>\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59813619fff7_Michael-Cohen-1.avif\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <h3><strong>Michael Cohen</strong></h3>\n          <p>General Manager of Bagel Corner</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1040px\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\"><a href=\"/en/ebook/developper-son-fast-food-le-guide-ultime\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"w-inline-block\">\n              <div><img alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/66b0e3d24a5e372d1a6ee0cd_655f7d9f44ef43bed9fe6995_Banni%25C3%25A8re%2520Blog%2520-%2520guide%2520ultime%2520(1).avif\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            </a></figure>\n        ",
